# Premium platform rules

Nixon Tours is not only a website. It must become a premium tourism platform with:

- Customer accounts
- Trip history
- Upcoming trips
- Manual payment tracking
- Premium memberships
- Affiliate program
- Promo codes
- Commission system
- Admin management

## User account rules

Users must be able to:

- Register
- Login
- Manage profile
- View bookings
- View past trips
- View upcoming trips
- Upload payment proofs
- Track payment progress
- Join premium membership
- Apply as affiliate
- View affiliate code and commissions

## Affiliate rules

- Affiliate commissions must be calculated only when a booking is confirmed or paid.
- Affiliate codes must be unique.
- Affiliate status must be approved by admin before earning commissions.
- Commission rates can be 10% to 15%.
- Admin can manually change commission rate per affiliate.

## Payment rules

Payments are manual for now. Accepted methods:

- Yappy
- Bank transfer
- Cash / manual admin record

Users upload proof. Admin approves or rejects. Never mark a payment as approved automatically.

## Membership rules

Premium membership gives users exclusive benefits. Membership status can be:

- active
- expired
- cancelled
- pending

## Admin rules

Admin must be able to manage:

- Users
- Bookings
- Payments
- Memberships
- Affiliates
- Commissions
- Promo codes
- Notifications

## Security rules

- Use Supabase Auth and RLS.
- Users can only access their own data.
- Admins can access all records.
- Validate all user input.
- Never expose private keys.

## UX rules

- The user dashboard must feel premium, simple and exciting.
- Use cards, progress bars, badges, timelines and clean navigation.
- The affiliate dashboard must motivate users to share their code.
- The premium membership page must feel aspirational and valuable.
